##### r1-modo grupal
Modo actual de R1-LAN: grupal
Enlaces de salida:
    up-squid         UP             192.168.84.2/30 
Ruta por defecto:
    default via 192.168.84.1 dev up-squid onlink 
NAT en R1: no (las IP de las VLAN salen sin traducir; el NAT lo hace el Multi-WAN)
--- rutas:
default via 192.168.84.1 dev up-squid onlink 
192.168.10.0/24 dev trunk0.10 proto kernel scope link src 192.168.10.1 
192.168.20.0/24 dev trunk0.20 proto kernel scope link src 192.168.20.1 
192.168.30.0/24 dev trunk0.30 proto kernel scope link src 192.168.30.1 
192.168.40.0/24 dev trunk0.40 proto kernel scope link src 192.168.40.1 
192.168.84.0/30 dev up-squid proto kernel scope link src 192.168.84.2 
--- cadenas nat: 0
table inet xelaju {
	chain entrada_modo {
		iifname "up-squid" ip saddr { 192.168.81.0/30, 192.168.82.0/30, 192.168.83.0/30, 192.168.84.0/30 } icmp type echo-request counter packets 0 bytes 0 accept
	}
}
table inet xelaju {
	chain ajuste_mss {
		type filter hook forward priority mangle; policy accept;
		oifname "up-squid" tcp flags syn tcp option maxseg size set rt mtu
	}
}

##### r1-modo individual
